sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as drafter / approver / admin<br/>or scheduled job
    participant LT as labeltree-db
    participant W as WoRMS API

    U->>LT: POST /trees/taxonomy/drift (run now)
    LT->>LT: set of AphiaIDs used in latest rev
    loop each AphiaID used
        LT->>W: AphiaRecordByAphiaID + AphiaClassificationByAphiaID
        W-->>LT: current status, valid_AphiaID, lineage
        LT->>LT: add WORMS_RECORD row if WoRMS modified changed
    end
    LT->>LT: re-run placement checks for the whole tree
    LT->>LT: overwrite NODE_FLAGS (no drift history kept)
    LT-->>U: nodes that currently have WoRMS warnings
    Note over U,LT: no changes are proposed. Any fix is an ordinary draft by a drafter
